    {
      "id": "p0100-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toriel suggests that she was considering baking \"snail pie\" to celebrate the main character’s arrival. This outlandish-sounding dish is a reference to Illusion of Gaia, one of Toby’s favorite Japanese games from the mid-1990s.",
        "raw": "Torie! suggests that she was considering baking \"snail pie\" to celebrate the\nmain character's arrival. This outlandish-sounding dish is a reference to\nIllusion of Gaia, one of Toby's favorite Japanese games from the mid-1990s.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.288526,
          0.2594,
          0.86569071,
          0.30785714
        ],
