    {
      "id": "p0100-b011",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "As a translation student, I was taught the importance of studying influential literature to broaden my knowledge base. I think the same is equally as important for entertainment translation, except you'd have to study hundreds of movies, play hundreds of games, and so on. I wonder if any universities out there study game translations the same way they study literary translations.",
        "raw": "As a translation student, I was taught the importance of studying influential\nliterature to broaden my knowledge base. I think the same is equally as\nimportant for entertainment translation, except you'd have to study hundreds\nof movies, play hundreds of games, and so on. I wonder if any universities out\nthere study game translations the same way they study literary translations.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.30964665,
          0.82286429,
          0.88554064,
          0.89469286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.30831444,
          0.82215,
          0.88687285,
          0.89576429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          61,
          62,
          63,
          64,
          65
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "学习翻译时，老师告诉我，要阅读有影响力的文学作品，拓宽知识面。我觉得娱乐作品的翻译也一样重要，只不过需要研究几百部电影、玩几百款游戏，诸如此类。不知道有没有大学会像研究文学翻译那样，研究游戏翻译。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
